'''absinthial''' (ab-sin′thi-al), ''a.'' Of or pertaining to wormwood; hence, bitter. ''N. E. D.''

'''absinthian''' (ab-sin′thi-an), ''a.'' Pertaining to or of the nature of wormwood.
